.TH MU2E-POWER-REPORT 1 "2026-09-17" "mu2edaq-power-recovery 0.1.0" "Mu2e DAQ Operations"
.SH NAME
mu2e-power-report \- phase 4: the consolidated recovery report
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mu2e-power-report
.RB [ \-\-run\-id
.IR N ]
.RB [ \-\-post\-ecl ]
.RB [ \-\-publish ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs phase 4 of
.BR mu2e-power-recovery (1):
it reads a run back out of the run store, renders the detailed report page, and
optionally posts it to the Fermilab Electronic Logbook.
.PP
This phase probes nothing, which is what makes it repeatable. An operator can
regenerate a report hours after the event, or repost it after fixing the
logbook credentials, without touching the cluster.
.PP
The narrative is derived entirely from stored rows, in the order a reader who
was not present needs them: what the run did, what is still wrong, and what has
to happen next. Follow-ups are derived rather than generic \(em a check that
failed on three or more nodes is called out as one likely shared cause rather
than as three separate problems.
.SH LOGBOOK POSTING
.B \-\-post\-ecl
posts the entry using the
.B ecl-client
package, which implements the ECL 8.x XML posting API. It is an optional
dependency: if it is not installed, or the ECL is unreachable, the phase
records that in its notes and the HTML report \(em the durable artefact \(em is
unaffected.
.PP
ECL credentials are read from Vault at the path given by
.I ecl.credential_path
under
.IR vault.base_path .
The generated HTML pages are attached when
.I ecl.attach_html
is set.
.SH OPTIONS
As
.BR mu2e-power-recovery (1),
with
.B \-\-phase
fixed to
.BR report .
.TP
.BI \-\-run\-id " N"
Report on this run rather than the most recent one. Run ids are shown on the
report's run-history page and by
.BR "mu2e-power-report \-\-json" .
.TP
.B \-\-post\-ecl
Post the entry to the logbook.
.TP
.B \-\-publish
Copy the report site to
.I report.publish.target
after rendering.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The report was generated and, if requested, posted.
.TP
.B 1
The report was generated but the run it describes contains failures.
.TP
.B 2
No run could be found to report on.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.EX
mu2e-power-report
mu2e-power-report \-\-run\-id 17 \-\-post\-ecl
mu2e-power-report \-\-publish \-\-publish\-target mu2edaq@mu2egateway01:/web/recovery/
.EE
.RE
